{"seq":2,"slug":"pneumatic-hydraulic-systems","title":"气压与液压传动","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/plc-automation/pneumatic-hydraulic-systems","wordCount":1587,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"气压与液压传动\">气压与液压传动</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>气压与液压传动是机电设备中实现直线运动和大推力输出的主要方式。相比电动执行机构，气缸和液压缸结构简单、推力大、动作迅速，广泛应用于夹紧、冲压、搬运、注塑等工业场景。机电技术人员必须掌握气液压系统的基本原理、回路设计和故障处理能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"气动元件与回路设计\">气动元件与回路设计</h3><p>气动系统以压缩空气为工作介质，典型系统由空压机→储气罐→气源处理三联件→控制阀→执行器（气缸/气马达）组成。</p>\n<p>核心元件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>常见型号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>气源处理三联件</td>\n<td>过滤、减压、油雾润滑</td>\n<td>AC3000 系列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电磁换向阀</td>\n<td>控制气流方向</td>\n<td>4V210（二位五通）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节流阀</td>\n<td>调节气缸速度</td>\n<td>ASC 系列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单作用气缸</td>\n<td>单方向出力</td>\n<td>弹簧复位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双作用气缸</td>\n<td>双方向出力</td>\n<td>需两路气源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>气缸推力计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = p \\cdot A = p \\cdot \\frac{\\pi d^2}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 为工作气压（通常 0.4-0.6 MPa），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为气缸活塞直径。</p>\n<p>例：气压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mtext>MPa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.5\\text{MPa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPa</span></span></span></span></span></span>，缸径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>63</mn><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 63\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 时：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>0.063</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1559</mn><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = 0.5 \\times 10^6 \\times \\frac{\\pi \\times 0.063^2}{4} \\approx 1559\\text{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.06</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1559</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>基本气动回路：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>单作用气缸控制</strong>：3/2 电磁阀控制进排气</li>\n<li><strong>双作用气缸控制</strong>：5/2 或 4/2 电磁阀控制两腔</li>\n<li><strong>速度控制</strong>：排气节流（用出口节流阀使运动平稳）</li>\n<li><strong>两缸顺序动作</strong>：气缸 A 到位 → 触发磁性开关 → 气缸 B 动作</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"液压系统基本原理\">液压系统基本原理</h3><p>液压传动以液压油为工作介质，遵循帕斯卡原理——密封容器内液体的压强能等值传递到各处。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1 = p_2, \\quad \\frac{F_1}{A_1} = \\frac{F_2}{A_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>液压系统的基本组成：油箱→液压泵→溢流阀→换向阀→液压缸→回油过滤器。</p>\n<p>液压相比气压的特点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比项</th>\n<th>气动</th>\n<th>液压</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工作压力</td>\n<td>0.4-0.8 MPa</td>\n<td>7-31.5 MPa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出力</td>\n<td>较小</td>\n<td>很大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动速度</td>\n<td>较快但不均匀</td>\n<td>可精确控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>介质</td>\n<td>空气（可压缩）</td>\n<td>液压油（不可压缩）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清洁度要求</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>严格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型应用</td>\n<td>夹紧、搬运</td>\n<td>冲压、注塑、机床进给</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>液压基本回路：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>调压回路</strong>：溢流阀设定系统最高工作压力</li>\n<li><strong>调速回路</strong>：节流阀控制执行器速度</li>\n<li><strong>顺序动作回路</strong>：顺序阀实现多缸先后动作</li>\n<li><strong>锁紧回路</strong>：液控单向阀保持缸位不动</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"电气-气动联合控制\">电气-气动联合控制</h3><p>现代机电设备通常采用&quot;电气控制 + 气动执行&quot;的方案。PLC 输出信号驱动电磁阀的线圈，电磁阀切换气路方向，气缸完成机械动作，磁性开关反馈到位信号给 PLC。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;PLC输出&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;电磁阀线圈&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;气缸动作&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;磁性开关&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;PLC输入&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"PLC输出\"] --&gt; B[\"电磁阀线圈\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"气缸动作\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"磁性开关\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"PLC输入\"]</pre><p>控制系统设计要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>电磁阀线圈电压与 PLC 输出类型匹配（DC24V 居多）</li>\n<li>磁性开关选型注意 NPN/PNP 与 PLC 输入类型一致</li>\n<li>急停时应考虑气缸残余压力——需要设计泄压回路或机械锁定</li>\n<li>动作时序通过 PLC 程序中的定时器和中间继电器实现</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"故障诊断与维护\">故障诊断与维护</h3><p>气动系统常见故障：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>故障现象</th>\n<th>可能原因</th>\n<th>排查方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>气缸不动</td>\n<td>气源中断/电磁阀卡死</td>\n<td>检查气压表、手动按阀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动作缓慢</td>\n<td>节流阀堵塞/气管漏气</td>\n<td>用肥皂水检漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>爬行</td>\n<td>润滑不良/密封件老化</td>\n<td>检查油雾器/更换密封圈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到位不准</td>\n<td>缓冲调节不当</td>\n<td>调整缓冲螺钉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>液压系统常见故障：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>油温过高：检查散热器、油液粘度是否合适</li>\n<li>系统压力不足：检查溢流阀设定、泵磨损情况</li>\n<li>油液污染：定期更换滤芯，检查油液颜色和气味</li>\n</ul>\n<p>日常维护要点：气动系统每班排放储气罐冷凝水、定期检查油雾器油量；液压系统每月检测油液清洁度、每季度更换回油滤芯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026 年气液压技术朝着节能化、智能化和集成化方向发展。比例阀和伺服阀替代传统的开关阀实现气缸和液压缸的精确位置控制；气动肌肉和柔性气动夹爪在柔性制造和协作机器人领域获得广泛应用；电液伺服系统结合了液压的大推力和伺服电机的高精度优势，成为大型装备的首选方案。此外，&quot;气电一体化&quot;岛式阀组产品将电磁阀、传感器和 IO 模块集成为一体，通过 PROFINET 或 EtherCAT 总线直接与 PLC 通信，大幅简化了接线和调试工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>设计一个&quot;气缸 A 伸出到位后，气缸 B 再伸出&quot;的顺序控制气动回路图，标注各元件型号并编写对应的 PLC 梯形图程序。</li>\n<li>某注塑机合模缸缸径 200mm，工作压力 12MPa，计算合模力。如果模具投影面积为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><msup><mtext>cm</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300\\text{cm}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在注射压力 80MPa 下是否能锁住模具？</li>\n<li>一台液压机在连续工作 2 小时后油温从 40°C 上升到 75°C，列出可能的原因和对应的解决措施。</li>\n<li>解释&quot;排气节流&quot;比&quot;进气节流&quot;控制气缸速度更平稳的原因（提示：考虑空气的可压缩性）。</li>\n<li>实训任务：在气动实训台上搭建一个&quot;自动送料-夹紧-钻孔&quot;三缸顺序控制回路，要求用 PLC 控制，包含手动/自动模式切换和紧急停止功能。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>气压与液压传动是机电设备实现大力量、快动作的关键技术。气动系统以其清洁、快速的特点适用于装配和搬运场景；液压系统凭借大推力和精确速度控制胜任重载加工任务。电气-气动联合控制方案将 PLC 的逻辑灵活性与气液压的执行能力结合，是当前制造业最普遍的控制架构。掌握系统设计、回路分析和故障排除技能，是机电维修工岗位的核心要求。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"气压与液压传动","id":"气压与液压传动"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"气动元件与回路设计","id":"气动元件与回路设计"},{"level":3,"text":"液压系统基本原理","id":"液压系统基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"电气-气动联合控制","id":"电气-气动联合控制"},{"level":3,"text":"故障诊断与维护","id":"故障诊断与维护"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"PLC编程基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/plc-automation/plc-programming-basics"},"next":{"title":"自动化生产线","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/mechatronics/plc-automation/automated-production-lines"}}